1
00:00:00,852 --> 00:00:02,022
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

2
00:00:02,187 --> 00:00:05,607
SHELDON:
Leonard? Leonard? Leonard?

3
00:00:06,316 --> 00:00:07,736
(Penny:)What is it?

4
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,860
I made tea.

5
00:00:11,655 --> 00:00:13,365
(Leonard:)I don't want tea.

6
00:00:14,032 --> 00:00:16,282
(Sheldon:)I didn't make tea for you.

7
00:00:18,286 --> 00:00:20,126
(Sheldon:)This is my tea.

8
00:00:20,914 --> 00:00:22,494
(Leonard:)Then why are you telling me?

9
00:00:22,958 --> 00:00:25,128
(Sheldon:)It's a conversation starter.

10
00:00:25,877 --> 00:00:28,337
(Leonard:)That's a lousy conversation starter.

11
00:00:28,505 --> 00:00:31,385
(Sheldon:)Oh, is it? We're conversing.
Checkmate.

12
00:00:32,718 --> 00:00:33,968
(Leonard:)What do you want, Sheldon?

13
00:00:34,136 --> 00:00:36,886
(Sheldon:)What I want is to be departing
the starship Enterprise...

14
00:00:37,055 --> 00:00:40,055
...in a one-man shuttlecraft
headed to the planetoid I rule...

15
00:00:40,225 --> 00:00:42,145
(Sheldon:)...known as Sheldon Alpha Five.

16
00:00:42,769 --> 00:00:44,649
Mm, I want that too.

17
00:00:45,814 --> 00:00:47,144
(Leonard:)Why are you here?

18
00:00:47,607 --> 00:00:49,067
(Sheldon:)To comfort you, of course.

19
00:00:51,611 --> 00:00:58,021
(Sheldon:)No, that's not going to work at all.
I'll comfort you from over here.

